  "details": "When inputting text, my normal method to input non-alphanumeric characters is to type in an external word processor, then copy/paste it in the entry field from two different apps.\n\nIt's a pain in the Quest to do this via external browser. It would be great for our international players to have accessibility to use other languages.\n\nI put in an example button of how the language could be switched. And perhaps there could either be wing implementation on the left or right side of the input field for language selection, or perhaps autocorrect or kanji selection.",
